! Forgotten Realms

The campaign setting Forgotten Realms for `tiddlyrpg-core`, as plugin type `setting` (required:
`tiddlyrpg-core`). Contains no code, only data and texts:

* `$:/tiddlyrpg/calendar/Harptos` - the Calendar of Harptos as calendar data (12 months of 30
  days, 5 festival days, Shieldmeet every 4 years); `$:/config/tiddlyrpg/calendar` makes it the
  calendar of the wiki
* `$:/tiddlyrpg/currency/ForgottenRealms` - the coins of the Forgotten Realms (cp, sp, ep, gp,
  pp, with the rates of the SRD 5.1); `$:/config/tiddlyrpg/currency` makes them the currency of
  the wiki: prices need a coin, the hub "Currency" converts them
* the rules domains `Calendar` and `Currency`: names of months, festivals and coins follow the
  rules language of the wiki (ControlPanel -> Settings -> TiddlyRPG)
* language keys `Calendar/Harptos/...` and `Currency/ForgottenRealms/...` (en-GB, de-DE).
  Month names and DR exist only in en-GB and are shown in English in every language

!! Own calendar or own coins

Copy `$:/tiddlyrpg/calendar/Harptos` or `$:/tiddlyrpg/currency/ForgottenRealms` into the wiki
under a new title, change the data and point `$:/config/tiddlyrpg/calendar` or `.../currency` to
it. Display
names go into `$:/tiddlyrpg/language/<code>/Calendar/<id>/...` or `.../Currency/<id>/...`;
without them the ids are shown. This plugin is not needed for that.
